<view class="container"><view wx:if="{{config.demo}}" class="demo">本机演示版 · 示例商品不是真实在售物品</view><view class="heji-header {{searching?'searching':''}}"><view wx:if="{{!searching}}" class="heji-brand">▣ 盒闲</view><view class="heji-search"><input placeholder="搜索校园好物" value="{{query}}" bindfocus="focusSearch" bindinput="inputSearch" bindconfirm="search" confirm-type="search" maxlength="80"/><text wx:if="{{searching}}" bindtap="closeSearch">取消</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{searching}}" class="suggestions"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="detail" data-id="{{item.id}}">{{item.title}} <text>¥{{item.priceLabel}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{!items.length}}">{{loading?'正在查找…':'暂无匹配商品'}}</view></view><view class="campus-line">● 同校好物，近在身边</view><swiper class="home-carousel" autoplay="{{!searching}}" interval="5000" duration="600" circular indicator-dots indicator-active-color="#819774"><swiper-item><view class="hero"><text class="eyebrow">给闲置一次新的出发</text><text class="hero-title">你的闲置，
恰好是我的心头好。</text><text class="muted">让好物在校园里流动，让喜欢继续发生。</text><view class="hero-tags">✦ 免费发布　↔ 当面交易　♡ 循环使用</view><view class="banner-book">THE
SECOND
CHAPTER</view></view></swiper-item><swiper-item><view class="hero warm"><text class="eyebrow">把温暖留给下一位同学</text><text class="hero-title">一盏灯的陪伴，
照亮新的日常。</text><text class="muted">从你的书桌，到另一位同学的夜读时光。</text><view class="hero-tags">✦ 宿舍好物　↔ 校园交接</view></view></swiper-item><swiper-item><view class="hero blue"><text class="eyebrow">让喜欢继续发生</text><text class="hero-title">收藏校园片刻，
不让热爱闲置。</text><text class="muted">带上刚刚好的装备，记录下一段故事。</text><view class="hero-tags">✦ 数码好物　♡ 循环使用</view></view></swiper-item></swiper><view class="section-title">发现校园好物</view><scroll-view class="categories" scroll-x><text wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{category === item || (!category &amp;&amp; index === 0) ? 'active' : ''}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="category">{{item}}</text></scroll-view><view class="grid"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="detail"><image class="card-img" mode="aspectFill" src="{{item.photos[0].url}}" lazy-load/><view class="card-body"><view class="card-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="row"><text class="price">¥{{item.priceLabel}}</text><text class="tag">{{item.delivery === 'pickup' ? '校园自取' : '支持送达'}}</text></view><view class="card-meta">{{item.seller_name}}</view></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{!loading &amp;&amp; !items.length}}" class="empty">{{error || '暂时没有找到好物，换个关键词试试。'}}<button wx:if="{{error}}" class="secondary" bindtap="search">重新加载</button></view><view class="loading">{{loading ? '正在加载…' : hasMore ? '上拉发现更多好物' : '让校园里的好物继续被喜欢'}}</view></view>
